  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_3391.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>99 fotos de la clausura del segundo y &uacute;ltimo turno de &#39;les Escoletes d&#39;Estiu&#39; de Onda, organizadas por el &aacute;rea de Eucaci&oacute;n y Cultura del Ayuntamiento y gestionadas por la empresa M&oacute;n d&#39;Animaci&oacute;. La ma&ntilde;ana de este jueves, la &#39;Esportiva&#39;&nbsp;se ha clausurado en las psicinas municipales de verano&nbsp;y la Infantil en el colegio Baltasar Rull, con canciones, bailes y el acompa&ntilde;amiento de familiares y amistades.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendasegontornescoletesesportivainfantil/img_3388.jpg\" alt=\"img_3388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendasegontornescoletesesportivainfantil/img_3389.jpg\" alt=\"img_3389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendasegontornescoletesesportivainfantil/img_3391.jpg\" alt=\"img_3391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendasegontornescoletesesportivainfantil/img_3393.jpg\" alt=\"img_3393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendasegontornescoletesesportivainfantil/img_3394.jpg\" alt=\"img_3394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendasegontornescoletesesportivainfantil/img_3395.jpg\" alt=\"img_3395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendasegontornescoletesesportivainfantil/img_3396.jpg\" alt=\"img_3396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"htt